    "role": "Creative artist",
    "p": [
      "I don't just click a moment, I feel it. Somewhere deep inside, a quiet voice tells me to stop, look and hold on to a scene before it slips away.",
      "It could be a wet leaf after the rain, an old scooter resting under a tree, or a sky turning orange above a railway station. I capture it on my phone, then sit with it and edit slowly, until the frame says what I felt in that one second.",
      "edm.frames is where those feelings live. Every post follows the same simple path: click, edit, upload."
